---@field deletable? boolean Output only. If set to true, this event can be deleted.
---@field name? string Output only. Resource name of this key event. Format: properties/{property}/keyEvents/{key_event}
---@field parent string Required. The resource name of the parent property where this Key Event will be created. Format: properties/123

---@class gcp.unstable.analyticsadmin_v1alpha.CreatePropertiesReportingDataAnnotationsRequest
