---@field timeZone? string Required. Reporting Time Zone, used as the day boundary for reports, regardless of where the data originates. If the time zone honors DST, Analytics will automatically adjust for the changes. NOTE: Changing the time zone only affects data going forward, and is not applied retroactively. Format: https://www.iana.org/time-zones Example: "America/Los_Angeles"
---@field parent? string Immutable. Resource name of this property's logical parent. Note: The Property-Moving UI can be used to change the parent. Format: accounts/{account}, properties/{property} Example: "accounts/100", "properties/101"
---@field displayName? string Required. Human-readable display name for this property. The max allowed display name length is 100 UTF-16 code units.
