---@field roles? gcp.unstable.analyticsadmin_v1alpha.StringList A list of roles for to grant to the parent resource. Valid values: predefinedRoles/viewer predefinedRoles/analyst predefinedRoles/editor predefinedRoles/admin predefinedRoles/no-cost-data predefinedRoles/no-revenue-data For users, if an empty list of roles is set, this AccessBinding will be deleted.

