---@field dimensionName? string The API name of the dimension. See [Data Access Schema](https://developers.google.com/analytics/devguides/config/admin/v1/access-api-schema) for the list of dimensions supported in this API. Dimensions are referenced by name in `dimensionFilter` and `orderBys`.

---Describes a dimension column in the report. Dimensions requested in a report produce column entries within rows and DimensionHeaders. However, dimensions used exclusively within filters or expressions do not produce columns in a report; correspondingly, those dimensions do not produce headers.
