---@field tokensPerProjectPerHour? gcp.unstable.analyticsadmin_v1alpha.GoogleAnalyticsAdminV1alphaAccessQuotaStatus Properties can use up to 25% of their tokens per project per hour. This amounts to Analytics 360 Properties can use 12,500 tokens per project per hour. An API request consumes a single number of tokens, and that number is deducted from all of the hourly, daily, and per project hourly quotas.
---@field concurrentRequests? gcp.unstable.analyticsadmin_v1alpha.GoogleAnalyticsAdminV1alphaAccessQuotaStatus Properties can use up to 50 concurrent requests.
---@field tokensPerHour? gcp.unstable.analyticsadmin_v1alpha.GoogleAnalyticsAdminV1alphaAccessQuotaStatus Properties can use 50,000 tokens per hour. An API request consumes a single number of tokens, and that number is deducted from all of the hourly, daily, and per project hourly quotas.
---@field serverErrorsPerProjectPerHour? gcp.unstable.analyticsadmin_v1alpha.GoogleAnalyticsAdminV1alphaAccessQuotaStatus Properties and cloud project pairs can have up to 50 server errors per hour.
---@field tokensPerDay? gcp.unstable.analyticsadmin_v1alpha.GoogleAnalyticsAdminV1alphaAccessQuotaStatus Properties can use 250,000 tokens per day. Most requests consume fewer than 10 tokens.

