---@field custom? boolean Output only. If set to true, this conversion event refers to a custom event. If set to false, this conversion event refers to a default event in GA. Default events typically have special meaning in GA. Default events are usually created for you by the GA system, but in some cases can be created by property admins. Custom events count towards the maximum number of custom conversion events that may be created per property.
