---@field fineValue? number The fine-grained conversion value. This is applicable only to the first postback window. Its valid values are [0,63], both inclusive. It must be set for postback window 1, and must not be set for postback window 2 & 3. This value is not guaranteed to be unique. If the configuration for the first postback window is re-used for second or third postback windows this field has no effect.
