---The customized Data Access Record Report response.
---@class gcp.unstable.analyticsadmin_v1alpha.GoogleAnalyticsAdminV1alphaRunAccessReportResponse
---@field quota? gcp.unstable.analyticsadmin_v1alpha.GoogleAnalyticsAdminV1alphaAccessQuota The quota state for this Analytics property including this request. This field doesn't work with account-level requests.
---@field metricHeaders? gcp.unstable.analyticsadmin_v1alpha.GoogleAnalyticsAdminV1alphaAccessMetricHeaderList The header for a column in the report that corresponds to a specific metric. The number of MetricHeaders and ordering of MetricHeaders matches the metrics present in rows.
